msgstr "PAP/CHAP"

#: edit.cpp:134
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>Specifies the method used to identify yourself to\n"
#| "the PPP server. Most universities still use\n"
#| "<b>Terminal</b>- or <b>Script</b>-based authentication,\n"
#| "while most ISP use <b>PAP</b> and/or <b>CHAP</b>. If\n"
